<span class="ltx_bibblock"><em id="bib.bib44.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">International Conference on Learning Representations (ICLR)</em>, 2023.

</span></li>
      
<li id="bib.bib45" class="ltx_bibitem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_role_refnum ltx_tag_bibitem">Wu et al. (2019)</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">
Yifan Wu, George Tucker, and Ofir Nachum.

</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">Behavior regularized offline reinforcement learning.

</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><em id="bib.bib45.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">arXiv preprint arXiv:1911.11361</em>, 2019.

</span></li>
      
